Exact source
------------

Source URL:        @SOURCE_URL@
Source tag:        @SOURCE_REF@
Source commit:     @SOURCE_COMMIT@
Source tree:       @SOURCE_TREE@
Source date epoch: @SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH@

The corresponding source is the complete source tree at the commit and
tree above. It can be obtained from the source URL and, where applicable,
from the referenced tag. The archive itself is a binary distribution and
does not contain the full source tree.

Build identity
--------------

Target:            Linux x86_64
Runtime contract:  single ELF, statically linked libstdc++/libgcc,
                   dynamically linked to the system glibc
Builder baseline:  Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS, glibc 2.35
Compiler:          GCC 13.4.0 (13.4.0-6ubuntu1~22~ppa2)
Build command:     make release BUILDROOT=<portable-root>
                   CXX='g++-13 -static-libstdc++ -static-libgcc'
Minimum platform:  x86-64 Linux with glibc 2.35 or newer
System libraries:  libc.so.6, libm.so.6, ld-linux-x86-64.so.2

The executable does not require libstdc++.so.6, libgcc_s.so.1 or a
project shared library at runtime. The system glibc remains dynamically
linked. Install the archive contents in a directory of your choice and run
`./xfoil.next-cli`. No installation step is required.

